============================================================
1. SYSTEM SUMMARY
============================================================
The KOC Council platform is a full‑stack web application providing
public content, member services, and administrative tools. It uses:

- React SPA (frontend)
- FastAPI (backend)
- Postgres (database)
- Redis (cache + Celery broker)
- Celery (background workers)
- K3s (self‑hosted Kubernetes cluster)
- Helm (deployment packaging)
- Ingress controller (routing + TLS)
- Persistent storage (PV/PVC)

The system is role‑aware, secure, and horizontally scalable.


